  "description": "In-process loopback transport for SetNet: a client and server sharing the same Host:Port connect entirely in memory — no sockets — while handlers, RPC, rooms and auth behave exactly as over TCP. Ideal for fast, deterministic integration tests and co-hosting a client and server in one process. config.UseInMemory(); depends only on SetNet.",
